;;; Motoi Sakura-cleanup Wave 2 report — 2026-07-16
;;; Executed by The Engineer (Opus 4.7), methodical one-at-a-time pass.
;;;
;;; Preceding wave: pass-3-wave-1-report-2026-07-16.slat (21 lib modules
